---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="Investment Focus | Venera Capital"
	description="Explore Venera Capital's investment sectors and Kazakhstan focus — Energy, Metals Processing, Mining, Food Production, Construction, and Financial Services."
>

	<!-- ── Page Hero ─────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
	<section class="page-hero bg-navy">
		<div class="container">
			<span class="section-eyebrow">What We Do</span>
			<h1 style="color:var(--white); font-weight:300; margin-bottom:0;">Investment Focus</h1>
			<hr class="divider" />
			<p style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.62); max-width:560px; font-size:1.05rem; line-height:1.85; margin:0;">
				We deploy capital across six core sectors in Kazakhstan and Central Asia, where structural economic dynamics create compelling long-term opportunities and where our team has deep on-the-ground expertise.
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- ── Investment Thesis ─────────────────────────────────────── -->
	<section class="section bg-off-white">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="section-header-centered">
				<span class="section-eyebrow">Investment Thesis</span>
				<h2>Why Kazakhstan Now</h2>
				<hr class="divider divider-center" />
			</div>
			<div class="thesis-grid">
				<div class="thesis-card">
					<span class="thesis-num">01</span>
					<h3>Landlocked Advantage</h3>
					<p>Global fragmentation is pushing companies to on-shore supply chains and source closer to final markets. Kazakhstan's position drives import substitution and higher-value processing of its abundant raw materials — creating defensible domestic businesses with structural tailwinds.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="thesis-card">
					<span class="thesis-num">02</span>
					<h3>Global Commodities Integration</h3>
					<p>Natural resources dominate Kazakhstan's economy, generating hard-currency cash flows that underpin macro stability. Mid-stream processing and value-added manufacturing within resource verticals — metals, food, construction materials — offer premium margins over raw extraction.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="thesis-card">
					<span class="thesis-num">03</span>
					<h3>Young Market Momentum</h3>
					<p>Kazakhstan's median age is under 30 and the population is projected to grow from 19 million today to over 26 million by 2050. A rapidly expanding urban middle class is driving sustained domestic demand across consumer, healthcare, and real-asset categories.</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- ── Sectors ───────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
	<section class="section bg-white">
		<div class="container">
			<span class="section-eyebrow">Our Sectors</span>
			<h2 style="margin-bottom:0;">Where We Invest</h2>
			<hr class="divider" style="margin-bottom:4rem;" />

			<div class="sector-row">
				<div class="sr-icon">
					<svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
						<path d="M4 25C4 25 10 18 20 18C30 18 36 25 36 25" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/>
						<circle cx="20" cy="28" r="5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" fill="none"/>
						<path d="M20 7V12" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
						<path d="M8 12L11 15" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
						<path d="M32 12L29 15" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
					</svg>
				</div>
				<div class="sr-content">
					<h3>Energy &amp; Infrastructure</h3>
					<p>Kazakhstan holds some of the world's largest oil and gas reserves, and significant renewable energy potential. We invest across the energy value chain — from upstream production to grid infrastructure and downstream distribution — as well as transport and logistics infrastructure that underpins the broader economy. Stable, long-duration assets with government-backed contracts provide compelling risk-adjusted returns.</p>
					<div class="tags">
						<span class="tag">Oil &amp; Gas</span>
						<span class="tag">Renewables</span>
						<span class="tag">Power Grid</span>
						<span class="tag">Transport &amp; Logistics</span>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="sector-row">
				<div class="sr-icon">
					<svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
						<path d="M20 4L36 13V27L20 36L4 27V13L20 4Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" fill="none"/>
						<path d="M20 13V27M13 17.5L27 22.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4"/>
					</svg>
				</div>
				<div class="sr-content">
					<h3>Metals Processing</h3>
					<p>Kazakhstan is a major producer of ferro-alloys, chrome, and specialty metals, but much of the value chain has historically sat offshore. The import-substitution dynamic and global supply-chain reshuffling create significant opportunity to build domestic processing capacity — converting raw ore into finished industrial inputs for regional and export markets at substantially higher margins.</p>
					<div class="tags">
						<span class="tag">Ferro-Alloys</span>
						<span class="tag">Chrome Processing</span>
						<span class="tag">Import Substitution</span>
						<span class="tag">Industrial Materials</span>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="sector-row">
				<div class="sr-icon">
					<svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
						<path d="M8 36L16 12L20 20L24 8L28 24L32 16L36 36H8Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" fill="none" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
					</svg>
				</div>
				<div class="sr-content">
					<h3>Mining — Precious &amp; Base Metals</h3>
					<p>Kazakhstan ranks among the world's top producers of uranium, gold, copper, manganese, zinc, and lead. We invest in operating mines and development-stage projects with strong geological endowment, clear title, and experienced operating teams — targeting assets where operational improvements or processing upgrades can significantly enhance value. Hard-currency export revenues provide a natural hedge.</p>
					<div class="tags">
						<span class="tag">Gold</span>
						<span class="tag">Copper</span>
						<span class="tag">Manganese</span>
						<span class="tag">Uranium</span>
						<span class="tag">Zinc &amp; Lead</span>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="sector-row">
				<div class="sr-icon">
					<svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
						<path d="M4 30C10 22 16 26 20 20C24 14 28 18 36 14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/>
						<rect x="4" y="30" width="32" height="4" rx="1" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" fill="none"/>
					</svg>
				</div>
				<div class="sr-content">
					<h3>Food Production &amp; Processing</h3>
					<p>Kazakhstan possesses significant arable land and livestock resources, yet imports substantial volumes of processed food products — creating a clear import-substitution opportunity. We invest in food processing businesses that convert Kazakhstan's agricultural raw materials into finished consumer and industrial products, capturing value domestically and building competitive export positions into adjacent markets.</p>
					<div class="tags">
						<span class="tag">Food Processing</span>
						<span class="tag">Agricultural Inputs</span>
						<span class="tag">Industrial Food</span>
						<span class="tag">Export Markets</span>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="sector-row">
				<div class="sr-icon">
					<svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
						<path d="M4 36V18L20 6L36 18V36H26V26H14V36H4Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" fill="none"/>
					</svg>
				</div>
				<div class="sr-content">
					<h3>Construction &amp; Building Materials</h3>
					<p>Rapid urbanisation — particularly in Astana — and a government-backed infrastructure investment programme are generating sustained demand for construction materials. We invest in producers of building materials that benefit from structural demand growth: cement, brick, dry mixes, insulation, and other inputs to residential and commercial construction, with strong pricing power over imported alternatives.</p>
					<div class="tags">
						<span class="tag">Building Materials</span>
						<span class="tag">Dry Mixes</span>
						<span class="tag">Residential Supply</span>
						<span class="tag">Infrastructure</span>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="sector-row" style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);">
				<div class="sr-icon">
					<svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
						<rect x="4" y="12" width="32" height="22" rx="2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" fill="none"/>
						<path d="M12 12V9C12 7.9 12.9 7 14 7H26C27.1 7 28 7.9 28 9V12" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" fill="none"/>
						<path d="M4 24H36" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4"/>
						<path d="M16 24V30M24 24V30" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4"/>
					</svg>
				</div>
				<div class="sr-content">
					<h3>Financial Services</h3>
					<p>Kazakhstan's financial sector is the most developed in Central Asia, yet remains underpenetrated relative to the economy's size and growth potential. We invest in financial institutions and services businesses — including banking, insurance, and specialised lending — with a particular focus on opportunities that benefit from our relationship with the Development Bank of Kazakhstan, through which we have co-invested and access exclusive pipeline.</p>
					<div class="tags">
						<span class="tag">Banking</span>
						<span class="tag">Insurance</span>
						<span class="tag">Specialised Lending</span>
						<span class="tag">Capital Markets</span>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- ── Example Investments ───────────────────────────────────── -->
	<section class="section bg-off-white">
		<div class="container">
			<span class="section-eyebrow">Example Investments</span>
			<h2 style="margin-bottom:0;">Investments &amp; Pipeline</h2>
			<hr class="divider" style="margin-bottom:4rem;" />
			<div class="examples-grid">
				<div class="example-card">
					<h5 class="ex-sector">Metals Processing</h5>
					<h4>HCGM Processing Plant</h4>
					<p>High-carbon ferro-manganese processing facility — converting locally mined ore into industrial alloy products for regional and export markets. Additional metals processing investments actively in pipeline.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="example-card">
					<h5 class="ex-sector">Food Production</h5>
					<h4>Taraz Gelatin Plant</h4>
					<p>Industrial gelatin production from domestic livestock inputs — supplying food, pharmaceutical, and industrial sectors across Kazakhstan and the CIS. Further food processing investments actively in pipeline.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="example-card">
					<h5 class="ex-sector">Mining</h5>
					<h4>Precious &amp; Base Metals Projects</h4>
					<p>Active investments across gold, copper, and manganese projects. Kazakhstan's world-class mineral endowment provides a broad and deep pipeline of development and operating opportunities.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="example-card">
					<h5 class="ex-sector">Construction &amp; Building Materials</h5>
					<h4>Asar Building Mixes</h4>
					<p>Producer of dry-mix construction materials serving Kazakhstan's residential and commercial construction sectors — directly linked to Astana's rapid urbanisation and the national housing programme. Pipeline closely tied to population growth.</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- ── Investment Criteria ───────────────────────────────────── -->
	<section class="section bg-white">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="criteria-grid">
				<div class="criteria-intro">
					<span class="section-eyebrow">Investment Criteria</span>
					<h2>What We Look For</h2>
					<hr class="divider" />
					<p style="color:var(--text-mid);">
						We seek businesses with strong fundamentals, defensible market positions, and significant growth potential within our target sectors. Our relationship with the Development Bank of Kazakhstan provides exclusive co-investment access and deal flow unavailable to most international investors.
					</p>
					<a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary" style="margin-top:1.5rem;">Discuss an Opportunity</a>
				</div>
				<div class="criteria-table">
					<div class="criteria-row">
						<span class="c-label">Investment Size</span>
						<span class="c-value">Growth capital to control buyouts</span>
					</div>
					<div class="criteria-row">
						<span class="c-label">Stage</span>
						<span class="c-value">Growth-stage and established businesses</span>
					</div>
					<div class="criteria-row">
						<span class="c-label">Structure</span>
						<span class="c-value">Control, co-control, and significant minority</span>
					</div>
					<div class="criteria-row">
						<span class="c-label">Holding Period</span>
						<span class="c-value">Typically 4–7 years</span>
					</div>
					<div class="criteria-row">
						<span class="c-label">Sectors</span>
						<span class="c-value">Energy, Metals, Mining, Food, Construction, Financial Services</span>
					</div>
					<div class="criteria-row">
						<span class="c-label">Geography</span>
						<span class="c-value">Kazakhstan primary; broader Central Asia selectively</span>
					</div>
					<div class="criteria-row">
						<span class="c-label">Edge</span>
						<span class="c-value">Development Bank of Kazakhstan partnership &amp; pipeline</span>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

</Layout>

<style>
	/* Thesis */
	.thesis-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
		gap: 1.5px;
		background: var(--border);
		border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
	}

	.thesis-card {
		background: var(--white);
		padding: 3rem 2.5rem;
		border-top: 3px solid var(--gold);
		transition: background var(--transition);
	}

	.thesis-card:hover { background: var(--off-white); }

	.thesis-num {
		display: block;
		font-family: var(--font-serif);
		font-size: 2.5rem;
		font-weight: 300;
		color: var(--gold);
		opacity: 0.4;
		line-height: 1;
		margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
	}

	.thesis-card h3 { font-size: 1.4rem; font-weight: 400; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
	.thesis-card p  { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-mid); line-height: 1.75; margin: 0; }

	/* Sector rows */
	.sector-row {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 80px 1fr;
		gap: 2.5rem;
		padding: 3.5rem 0;
		border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
		align-items: start;
	}

	.sr-icon { color: var(--gold); padding-top: 0.4rem; }

	.sr-content h3 { font-size: 1.65rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
	.sr-content p  {
		color: var(--text-mid);
		font-size: 0.93rem;
		line-height: 1.78;
		max-width: 680px;
		margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
	}

	.tags { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem; }

	.tag {
		font-size: 0.68rem;
		font-weight: 500;
		letter-spacing: 0.1em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		padding: 0.3rem 0.8rem;
		border: 1px solid var(--border);
		color: var(--text-mid);
		background: var(--off-white);
	}

	/* Example Investments */
	.examples-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
		gap: 1.5px;
		background: var(--border);
		border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
	}

	.example-card {
		background: var(--white);
		padding: 2.75rem 2.25rem;
		transition: background var(--transition);
	}

	.example-card:hover { background: var(--off-white); }

	.ex-sector {
		color: var(--gold);
		margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
	}

	.example-card h4 {
		font-family: var(--font-serif);
		font-size: 1.4rem;
		font-weight: 400;
		margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
		color: var(--navy);
	}

	.example-card p {
		font-size: 0.875rem;
		color: var(--text-mid);
		line-height: 1.7;
		margin: 0;
	}

	/* Criteria */
	.criteria-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.5fr;
		gap: 5rem;
		align-items: start;
	}

	.criteria-table {
		border-left: 1px solid var(--border);
		padding-left: 4rem;
	}

	.criteria-row {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: space-between;
		align-items: baseline;
		gap: 2rem;
		padding: 1.15rem 0;
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
	}

	.criteria-row:first-child { border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }

	.c-label {
		font-size: 0.68rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		letter-spacing: 0.15em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: var(--text-muted);
		flex-shrink: 0;
		width: 130px;
	}

	.c-value {
		font-size: 0.875rem;
		color: var(--text-dark);
		text-align: right;
	}

	@media (max-width: 900px) {
		.thesis-grid    { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
		.sector-row     { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1.25rem; }
		.sr-icon        { display: none; }
		.examples-grid  { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
		.criteria-grid  { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 3rem; }
		.criteria-table { border-left: none; padding-left: 0; }
	}

	@media (max-width: 600px) {
		.criteria-row { flex-direction: column; gap: 0.25rem; }
		.c-value      { text-align: left; }
	}
</style>
